  "title": "Pattern Recognized as One of America's 100 Most Loved Workplaces® of 2025",
  "summary": "Pattern Group Inc. (Nasdaq: PTRN) (“Pattern”), a leader in accelerating brands on global ecommerce marketplaces by leveraging proprietary technology and AI, today announced it has been selected as one of America’s Top 100 Most Loved Workplaces® of 2025, a list presented by the Wall Street Journal in collaboration with the Best Practice Institute.",
